383 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 197 0 R
/T (As necessary as reliability is, it alone will not build trust in an interpersonal relationship. There are more elements involved. The second is acceptance. )
/E (As necessary as reliability is, it alone will not build trust in an interpersonal relationship. There are more elements involved. The second is acceptance. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
384 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 197 0 R
/T (All people want to be accepted for who they are. Not judged, criticised or made to feel inferior. It is easy to give the impression to others that they are slightly stupid or inadequate for not understanding as much about the company, department, or project as the person involved understands. Or, the other person may feel 'put down' by the use of technical jargon, obscure references, or guilt accusations that they are not aware of or familiar with. )
