<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 198 0 R
/T (The third element of trust is openness. People tend to want to cooperate best with people who will 'level' with them, not hide anything, and give them the whole story \(even though some of the details may be a bit unpleasant\).)
/E (The third element of trust is openness. People tend to want to cooperate best with people who will 'level' with them, not hide anything, and give them the whole story \(even though some of the details may be a bit unpleasant\).)
/Pg 24 0 R
