407 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 198 0 R
/T ('People can take good news or bad news, but they can't take surprises.' If you discover there has been a change of plans that affects another person, or you are displeased with work results or family experiences, your related person should be the first to know. The other person will respect and trust you more for your openness. You will be the kind of person that is known as honest and straightforward, and \(if acceptable is included in openness\) people will want to relate with you. Besides, if you openly tell the people you relate with about how you feel, what you think and believe and what you consider priorities, you will be more believable. People relate better with people they trust.)
/E ('People can take good news or bad news, but they can't take surprises.' If you discover there has been a change of plans that affects another person, or you are displeased with work results or family experiences, your related person should be the first to know. The other person will respect and trust you more for your openness. You will be the kind of person that is known as honest and straightforward, and \(if acceptable is included in openness\) people will want to relate with you. Besides, if you openly tell the people you relate with about how you feel, what you think and believe and what you consider priorities, you will be more believable. People relate better with people they trust.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [3]
>>
