/E (Congruence sounds the same as reliability, but there is a difference. Reliability means following up and seeing through the promises and commitments you make. It means 'I'll do what I say I'll do'. Congruence means saying and doing what you believe in the moment, being straightforward and honest, saying what is true, even if it is unpleasant and not exactly what you think the other person wants to hear.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
